+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <title>Privacy Policy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <style>
+    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #3e2723; background: #fafafa; margin: 0; }
+    main { max-width: 760px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
+    h1, h2 { color: #4e342e; }
+    h2 { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
+    a { color: #4e342e; }
+  </style>
+</head>
+
+<body>
+  <main>
+    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
+    <p><a href="/">&larr; Back to home</a></p>
+
+    <h2>What we collect</h2>
+    <p>This website collects nothing. It has no accounts, forms, analytics, advertising, or tracking, and it sets no cookies and uses no local storage.</p>
+
+    <h2>Third parties</h2>
+    <p>All images, styles, and fonts are served from our own domain. Your browser does not contact any third party when you visit this site, so no one else learns that you were here. Our content security policy enforces this.</p>
+
+    <h2>Server logs</h2>
+    <p>Our server does not write access logs containing IP addresses. Any hosting-provider logs are limited to what the provider needs to run the service and are kept for the shortest period they allow.</p>
+
+    <h2>If this changes</h2>
+    <p>Before we collect any personal data we will collect only what is necessary for a stated purpose, ask for consent where required, document the new processing and any new third party in <code>PRIVACY.md</code>, and update this page.</p>
+
+    <h2>Security</h2>
+    <p>The site is served over HTTPS only with strict security headers. To report a vulnerability, see our <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">security.txt</a>.</p>
+  </main>
+</body>
+
+</html>
